{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_cdd7ac2457294bc3b6e96fe5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t(ns yin.vm.continuation-invoke-test\n2\t  \"Applying a `:reified-continuation` (src/cljc/yin/vm/docs/co-routines.md,\n3\t   call/cc): abortive, multi-shot, store not rolled back, one argument. Each\n4\t   program runs on all four VMs -- the AST walker, the semantic VM, and the\n5\t   de Bruijn stack and register VMs -- with the same expectation.\"\n6\t  (:require [yin.vm.semantic.linearize :as sr-linearize]\n7\t            [yin.vm.semantic.derive :as derive]\n8\t            [clojure.test :refer [deftest is testing]]\n9\t            [yin.vm :as vm]\n10\t\n11\t            [yin.vm.debruijn.register :as rvm]\n12\t            [yin.vm.debruijn.stack :as dvm]\n13\t            [yin.vm.semantic :as semantic]\n14\t            [yin.vm.test-utils :as tu]))\n15\t\n16\t\n17\t;; =============================================================================\n18\t;; The four VMs\n19\t;; =============================================================================\n20\t\n21\t(def ^:private opts\n22\t  {:make-stream tu/make-stream,\n23\t   :capability-secret tu/secret,\n24\t   :primitives vm/primitives})\n25\t\n26\t\n27\t(def ^:private load-semantic-ast\n28\t  (vm/fresh-code-loader semantic/load-ast\n29\t                        vm/ast-contract))\n30\t\n31\t\n32\t(def ^:private runners\n33\t  {:ast-walker tu/compile-and-run,\n34\t   :semantic (fn [ast]\n35\t               (vm/value (vm/run (load-semantic-ast (semantic/create-vm opts)\n36\t                                                    (vm/ast->datoms ast)))))\n37\t   :stack (fn [ast]\n38\t            (vm/value\n39\t              (vm/run (dvm/create-vm (:image (derive/stack-image (:vector (sr-linearize/project ast))))\n40\t                                     (assoc opts\n41\t                                            :contract vm/stack-contract)))))\n42\t   :register (fn [ast]\n43\t               (vm/value\n44\t                 (vm/run\n45\t                   (rvm/create-vm\n46\t                     (derive/register-image (:vector (sr-linearize/project ast)))\n47\t                     (assoc opts :contract vm/register-contract)))))})\n48\t\n49\t\n50\t(defn- on-every-vm\n51\t  \"`[vm-key result]` for each VM; a throw becomes `[:thrown message]`.\"\n52\t  [ast]\n53\t  (into {}\n54\t        (map (fn [[k run]]\n55\t               [k (try (run ast)\n56\t                       (catch #?(:clj Exception\n57\t                                 :cljs :default\n58\t                                 :cljd Object)\n59\t                              e\n60\t                         [:thrown (ex-message e)]))]))\n61\t        runners))\n62\t\n63\t\n64\t(defn- every-vm=\n65\t  [expected ast]\n66\t  (let [results (on-every-vm ast)]\n67\t    (doseq [[k result] results]\n68\t      (is (= expected result) (str k)))))\n69\t\n70\t\n71\t;; =============================================================================\n72\t;; AST helpers\n73\t;; =============================================================================\n74\t\n75\t(defn- lit\n76\t  [x]\n77\t  {:type :literal, :value x})\n78\t\n79\t\n80\t(defn- v\n81\t  [sym]\n82\t  {:type :variable, :name sym})\n83\t\n84\t\n85\t(defn- lam\n86\t  [params body]\n87\t  {:type :lambda, :params params, :body body})\n88\t\n89\t\n90\t(defn- app\n91\t  [op & args]\n92\t  {:type :application, :operator op, :operands (vec args)})\n93\t\n94\t\n95\t(defn- tail\n96\t  [node]\n97\t  (assoc node :tail? true))\n98\t\n99\t\n100\t(defn- if-node\n101\t  [t c a]\n102\t  {:type :if, :test t, :consequent c, :alternate a})\n103\t\n104\t\n105\t(def ^:private capture {:type :vm/current-continuation})\n106\t\n107\t\n108\t(defn- def!\n109\t  [sym val]\n110\t  (app (v 'yin/def) (lit sym) val))\n111\t\n112\t\n113\t(defn- then\n114\t  \"Evaluate `first-node` for effect, then `next-node`.\"\n115\t  [first-node next-node]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b22ab98-3808-492f-99b7-216dd4cf8345","uuid":"71c2bc74-1708-4b80-8643-6b2eaaa66b62","timestamp":"2026-11-19T15:41:01.101Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-fixorder/test/yin/vm/continuation_invoke_test.cljc","content":"(ns yin.vm.continuation-invoke-test\n  \"Applying a `:reified-continuation` (src/cljc/yin/vm/docs/co-routines.md,\n   call/cc): abortive, multi-shot, store not rolled back, one argument. Each\n   program runs on all four VMs -- the AST walker, the semantic VM, and the\n   de Bruijn stack and register VMs -- with the same expectation.\"\n  (:require [yin.vm.semantic.linearize :as sr-linearize]\n            [yin.vm.semantic.derive :as derive]\n            [clojure.test :refer [deftest is testing]]\n            [yin.vm :as vm]\n\n            [yin.vm.debruijn.register :as rvm]\n            [yin.vm.debruijn.stack :as dvm]\n            [yin.vm.semantic :as semantic]\n            [yin.vm.test-utils :as tu]))\n\n\n;; =============================================================================\n;; The four VMs\n;; =============================================================================\n\n(def ^:private opts\n  {:make-stream tu/make-stream,\n   :capability-secret tu/secret,\n   :primitives vm/primitives})\n\n\n(def ^:private load-semantic-ast\n  (vm/fresh-code-loader semantic/load-ast\n                        vm/ast-contract))\n\n\n(def ^:private runners\n  {:ast-walker tu/compile-and-run,\n   :semantic (fn [ast]\n               (vm/value (vm/run (load-semantic-ast (semantic/create-vm opts)\n                                                    (vm/ast->datoms ast)))))\n   :stack (fn [ast]\n            (vm/value\n              (vm/run (dvm/create-vm (:image (derive/stack-image (:vector (sr-linearize/project ast))))\n                                     (assoc opts\n                                            :contract vm/stack-contract)))))\n   :register (fn [ast]\n               (vm/value\n                 (vm/run\n                   (rvm/create-vm\n                     (derive/register-image (:vector (sr-linearize/project ast)))\n                     (assoc opts :contract vm/register-contract)))))})\n\n\n(defn- on-every-vm\n  \"`[vm-key result]` for each VM; a throw becomes `[:thrown message]`.\"\n  [ast]\n  (into {}\n        (map (fn [[k run]]\n               [k (try (run ast)\n                       (catch #?(:clj Exception\n                                 :cljs :default\n                                 :cljd Object)\n                              e\n                         [:thrown (ex-message e)]))]))\n        runners))\n\n\n(defn- every-vm=\n  [expected ast]\n  (let [results (on-every-vm ast)]\n    (doseq [[k result] results]\n      (is (= expected result) (str k)))))\n\n\n;; =============================================================================\n;; AST helpers\n;; =============================================================================\n\n(defn- lit\n  [x]\n  {:type :literal, :value x})\n\n\n(defn- v\n  [sym]\n  {:type :variable, :name sym})\n\n\n(defn- lam\n  [params body]\n  {:type :lambda, :params params, :body body})\n\n\n(defn- app\n  [op & args]\n  {:type :application, :operator op, :operands (vec args)})\n\n\n(defn- tail\n  [node]\n  (assoc node :tail? true))\n\n\n(defn- if-node\n  [t c a]\n  {:type :if, :test t, :consequent c, :alternate a})\n\n\n(def ^:private capture {:type :vm/current-continuation})\n\n\n(defn- def!\n  [sym val]\n  (app (v 'yin/def) (lit sym) val))\n\n\n(defn- then\n  \"Evaluate `first-node` for effect, then `next-node`.\"\n  [first-node next-node]","numLines":115,"startLine":1,"totalLines":202}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_cdd7ac2457294bc3b6e96fe5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
