ompile with-empty-sem)))\n          \"empty metadata is no content: the payload matches the plain one\")\n      (is (strictly-ascending? (pair-keys (last (map-constructors\n                                                  (yang/compile with-sem)))))))))\n\n\n'''\nt = t[:i] + new + t[k:]\np.write_text(t)\nprint(\"metadata control replaced\")\nPYEOF\nclojure -M:test -n yang.clojure-collection-order-test -v yang.clojure-collection-order-test/order-pairing-multiplicity-oracle-test 2>&1 | tail -3","description":"Metadata control via marker replacement","timeout":900000}}}
